2026-11-19T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2499) 'HairDeck (single image to hair cards, Apache-2.0) ships as Python on Blender. Its five models
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2499  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-19T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2499) 'now run as ggml-rd (ggml on the engine's GPU) guests and match PyTorch within 5e-5. 26
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2499  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-19T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2499) 'portraits gave 26 VRMs in one viewer process, about 7 s each after a 20 s load. The masks
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2499  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-19T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2499) 'still come from SAM 3 and BiRefNet in PyTorch. SAM 3 is under Meta's SAM licence.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2499  1 LINE
 Text:Written

