2026-11-19T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2499) 'Mask quality was measured against the SAM 3 masks on the same 26 images, given the box of
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2499  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-19T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2499) 'the SAM 3 mask. SAM 2.1 base-plus reached a mean IoU of 0.83 on hair and 0.92 on face, and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2499  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-19T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2499) 'six hair masks fell below 0.7. SAM 2.1 large reached 0.85 and 0.91 at 2.6 times the encode
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2499  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-19T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2499) 'time, so base-plus is the choice. Box detectors were measured on the same images by box IoU:
 # tags: rfd:details
